  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Boil the kettle. Peel potato and cut into large chunks.<br>• Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.<br>• Cook potato in boiling water over high heat until easily pierced with a fork, 12-15 mins.<br>• Drain and return to saucepan. Add the milk and butter and season generously with salt. Mash until smooth.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6948a1c639d4849fb4578411/step-021c5e00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, grate carrot. Finely chop brown onion (see ingredients) and garlic. Drain and rinse lentils. Cut zucchini into bite-sized chunks.<br>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. Cook carrot, onion, lentils and zucchini until softened, 5-6 mins. <br>• Reduce heat to medium-low, then add garlic, chermoula spice blend and tomato paste and cook until fragrant, 1-2 mins.<br>• Stir in coconut milk, the water and stock powder and cook, stirring, until combined, 2-3 mins. Season with pepper.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6948a1c639d4849fb4578411/step-e7d65b10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat grill to high. Transfer lentil filling to a baking dish and spread evenly with mash.<br>• Drizzle with olive oil and grill until lightly golden, 5-8 mins.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6948a1c639d4849fb4578411/step-9732ed20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide chermoula coconut and veggie pie between plates.<br>• Sprinkle with the chilli flakes (if using) to serve.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6948a1c639d4849fb4578411/step-29660730.jpeg"
    }
  ]
